{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞太經合組織（APEC）財長會議舉行在即，部分成員經濟體陸續確認或公布與會官員。</p><p>其中，美國預計由副財長Francis Brooke及助理部長Erin Browne率團參與；</p><p>加拿大公布由財政部國會秘書Ryan Turnbull來港參與。</p><p>俄羅斯方面，據了解將由一名副財長來港出席。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:50.864141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:39:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:57:38.049339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:33.570125+00:00","content_hash":"4fdc1ac6f364968de7cef17162c8c8f2380d2f099c0973d49e24e0d0963b7232","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}